          "id": "3e551be8-2d65-4d99-9058-38ac9b005b9b",
          "memory": "On the morning of September 19, 2026, User's cat did laps around the bed at 7 a.m. waking User, while Devon's cat woke Devon at 8 a.m. screaming for food, leading them to joke the cats should hang out and leave them alone.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "4a52c6bc-5541-4023-aaa2-6b90c680e0a2",
          "memory": "Devon recommended reheating leftover Luigi's pizza in a dry pan on medium for about 5 minutes with a splash of water and lid at the end to melt cheese without burning bottom, keeping crust crispy versus soggy microwave. User planned to try it for lunch on September 19, 2026.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "196291db-eaeb-4145-baae-4e9814cf5773",
          "memory": "Following the September 18, 2026 dinner at Luigi's, Devon ate a leftover slice for breakfast on September 19, 2026 and User still had two slices in the fridge planned for lunch. Both said their garlic knots did not survive the night, with Devon eating his in the car.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "5d5ed675-7172-4ac6-80f7-0ec6f4f2497f",
          "memory": "On September 19, 2026, User had mostly finished laundry with one load still in the dryer, while Devon still needed to do his laundry and had no clean socks. User joked that Devon always runs out of socks first, which Devon called a talent.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "f836d3ff-e15a-4d13-82c0-96dc047f1fde",
          "memory": "Devon confirmed on September 19, 2026 that Sunday lunch on September 20, 2026 at his mom's house was still on after she texted that morning. She is making extra potato salad for User, and User said they will probably come by after noon.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "193a2368-3521-44ba-a85f-51b0a7d6b463",
          "memory": "Devon finished his work report chart on September 18, 2026 before leaving work, resolving the issue where his boss kept pinging him. When User asked on September 19, 2026 if work bugged him again, Devon said no, thank god.",
          "event": "ADD"
        }
